ter gap-2 font-bold hover:cursor-pointer w-fit pt-1.5 pb-1.25 px-6 bg-nzx-blue-70 text-kokako-grey-0 hover:bg-nzx-blue-60 hover:text-kokako-grey-0 active:bg-nzx-blue-50 active:border-none active:text-kokako-grey-0 focus-visible:outline-8 focus-visible:outline-nzx-blue-50 disabled:bg-kokako-grey-50 whitespace-nowrap" data-testid="Button"><span>Login<!-- --> </span></button></span><span class="hidden lg:inline"><span data-testid="diamond-separator" class="box-content rotate-45 hidden xl:inline-block h-2 w-2 bg-kokako-grey-50"></span><a class="hover:text-nzx-blue-50 cursor-pointer no-underline text-kokako-grey-0 group ml-6 font-extrabold" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://nzxgroup.com">NZX Group<svg data-testid="SvgIcon" aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-sharp-svg text-kokako-grey-0 group-hover:text-nzx-blue-50 icon-size-5 ml-2" viewBox="0 0 960 960" focusable="false"><use href="/assets/icons/spritemap-7bfcb9210851.svg#OpenExternal"></use></svg></a></span><span class="lg:hidden"><a data-testid="SectionItem" class="box-border inline-block border-b-8 py-5 font-extrabold tracking-normal border-learning text-kokako-grey-0 group-hover:border-learning group-hover:text-white hover:border-learning translate-y-1 md:translate-y-0 md:pt-7 md:pb-5" target="_self" href="/learning/issuer-participant-resources/listing-on-nzx-markets#"><span class="pt-4.5"><span class="relative top-1 md:hidden"><svg data-testid="SvgIcon" aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-sharp-svg cursor-pointer text-white" viewBox="0 0 960 960" focusable="false"><use href="/assets/icons/spritemap-7bfcb9210851.svg#Menu"></use></svg></span><span class="hidden md:inline-block"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 uppercase">learning<svg data-testid="SvgIcon" aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-sharp-svg text-kokako-grey-50" viewBox="0 0 960 960" focusable="false"><use href="/assets/icons/spritemap-7bfcb9210851.svg#CaretDown"></use></svg></span></span></span></a></span></span></div></div></header></div><main class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between"><section class="max-w-layout mx-auto mt-6 mb-12 flex w-full flex-1 gap-6 px-6 lg:gap-12 lg:px-12 flex-col" data-testid="Layout"><a class="cursor-pointer no-underline flex w-max items-center gap-2 py-2 leading-140 font-bold text-nzx-blue-70 hover:text-nzx-blue-50" target="_self" href="/learning"><svg data-testid="SvgIcon" aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-sharp-svg" viewBox="0 0 960 960" focusable="false"><use href="/assets/icons/spritemap-7bfcb9210851.svg#ArrowLeft"></use></svg><span class="">Home: Learning Centre </span></a><div class="flex w-full flex-1 flex-col-reverse gap-6 md:flex-row lg:gap-12"><section class="w-full md:w-2/3 lg:w-3/4" data-testid="MainContent"><h1>Listing on NZX</h1><div style="height:auto;width:auto" data-ntpc="YouTubeEmbed"><lite-youtube videoid="iY22q_GhCRw" playlabel="Listing on NZX" style="max-width: 100%;"></lite-youtube></div><p class="my-6">NZX provides a world class exchange platform to access capital and engage investors, employees and the general public in your business’s growth story. </p><div class="stack " style="overflow-x:hidden;overflow-y:hidden" data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="1aJhuFo3UrxNekFcFRQotL"><div data-testid="Grid" class="grid grid-lg-3 grid-sm-1" style="gap:0px"><div class="tile text-center border-true " data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="39h47h5JXMeGX8WitfF0qx"><div class="tile-name">$1934m</div><div class="tile-title"><p class="my-6">Total equity listed and raised YTD 2026<sup>1,3</sup></p></div></div><div class="tile text-center border-true " data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="6C6julCD2TBRCqFcozXE8O"><div class="tile-name">$3238m</div><div class="tile-title"><p class="my-6">Total debt raised YTD 2026<sup>1</sup></p></div></div><div class="tile text-center border-true " data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="3s1OjWzQwLebMX3sIyjIf9"><div class="tile-name">$1873m</div><div class="tile-title"><p class="my-6">Total funds raised YTD 2026<sup>1</sup></p></div></div></div><div data-testid="Grid" class="grid grid-lg-3 grid-sm-1" style="gap:0px"><div class="tile text-center border-true " data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="43yWrXT37G4VFe9FHBeied"><div class="tile-name">70.2%</div><div class="tile-title"><p class="my-6">Total value traded on Market<sup>1</sup></p></div></div><div class="tile text-center border-true " data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="6uMhXt5Cg7jw6bs2WOa5hX"><div class="tile-name">54.6%</div><div class="tile-title"><p class="my-6">Total market capitalization as a % of GDP<sup>1</sup></p></div></div><div class="tile text-center border-true " data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="7ainj4Bv0ixzz44BbiXXSY"><div class="tile-name">$27,393m</div><div class="tile-title"><p class="my-6">Total value traded YTD 2026<sup>1</sup></p></div></div></div><div data-testid="Grid" class="grid grid-lg-3 grid-sm-1" style="gap:0px"><div class="tile text-center border-true " data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="YT2A8Pe10ienLFo2mTJpb"><div class="tile-name">$6,025m</div><div class="tile-title"><p class="my-6">Total listed green bonds<sup>1</sup></p></div></div><div class="tile text-center border-true " data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="1Uv0qvcoQQyC66iX9v2UKf"><div class="tile-name">197</div><div class="tile-title"><p class="my-6">Total unique issuers on NZX Boards<sup>1</sup></p></div></div></div></div><p class="my-6">The New Zealand Main Board for equities and funds (NZSX) and New Zealand Debt Market (NZDX) are home to a variety of businesses. They include debt and equity issuers, cooperatives and managed funds. They reflect the unique nature of New Zealand’s economic environment. NZX is always happy to discuss how to meet the unique needs of your business in a listed environment. </p><div data-testid="Panel" id="4BdXpbGbBltp4NMgA4Yd3L" class="panel max-w-layout default    "><div class="panel-content text-left"><p class="my-6"><b>You can learn more about listing equity </b><a style="font-weight:bold" class="hover:text-nzx-blue-50 text-nzx-blue-70 cursor-pointer no-underline" target="_self" href="/services/listing-on-nzx-markets/equity">here</a><b> and funds </b><a style="font-weight:bold" class="hover:text-nzx-blue-50 text-nzx-blue-70 cursor-pointer no-underline" target="_self" href="/services/listing-on-nzx-markets/funds">here</a><b>. </b></p><p class="my-6"><b>For more information about debt listings on the NZDX, visit us </b><a style="font-weight:bold" class="hover:text-nzx-blue-50 text-nzx-blue-70 cursor-pointer no-underline" target="_self" href="/services/listing-on-nzx-markets/debt">here</a>.</p></div></div><div class="contact-information-panel"><h4 class="contact-information-panel-header text-center">Capital Markets Origination Team</h4><div data-testid="Grid" class="grid grid-lg-2 grid-sm-1" style="gap:30px"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4" title="GM – Listings, Information Services and Environmental Markets " data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="5MvTFVGASjGnroeSQyGOKs" data-testid="ContactInformation"><div><h4 class="text-kotukutuku-indigo-90">Jeremy Anderson</h4><div class="py-2">GM – Listings, Information Services and Environmental Markets</div></div><div class="flex gap-2 py-2"><svg data-testid="SvgIcon" aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-sharp-svg" viewBox="0 0 960 960" focusable="false"><use href="/assets/icons/spritemap-7bfcb9210851.svg#Phone"></use></svg> <!-- -->+ 64 21 819 715</div><div class="flex gap-2 py-2"><svg data-testid="SvgIcon" aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-sharp-svg" viewBox="0 0 960 960" focusable="false"><use href="/assets/icons/spritemap-7bfcb9210851.svg#Email"></use></svg><a class="hover:text-nzx-blue-50 text-nzx-blue-70 cursor-pointer no-underline" target="_